1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,317
Einstein. Genius. Failed maths.

2
00:00:03,467 --> 00:00:05,517
Except... he didn't.

3
00:00:05,667 --> 00:00:08,350
Einstein: the maths myth.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,817
By 15, he'd taught himself calculus.

5
00:00:11,967 --> 00:00:15,550
His words: "I never failed in mathematics."

6
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,750
So where did it come from?

7
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:22,517
In 1935, a newspaper column said he flunked.

8
00:00:22,667 --> 00:00:25,350
Einstein saw it and laughed.

9
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:29,150
One theory: his Swiss school flipped its grades.

10
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,483
6 was the top mark.

11
00:00:31,633 --> 00:00:34,283
He got 6s in maths.

12
00:00:34,433 --> 00:00:37,617
He did fail one exam, at 16.

13
00:00:37,767 --> 00:00:41,783
A university entrance exam. Two years early.

14
00:00:41,933 --> 00:00:45,383
He aced maths and physics. Not the rest.

15
00:00:45,533 --> 00:00:48,017
A year later, he got in.

16
00:00:48,167 --> 00:00:51,817
But "genius fails maths" is a better story.

17
00:00:51,967 --> 00:00:54,050
So the story stuck.

18
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:57,550
Einstein's maths grades: top marks.

19
00:00:57,700 --> 00:01:00,650
Times he failed maths: zero.

20
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:04,550
Anyway, here's Einstein failing maths.
